{"version":1,"content":"<p>藝人馮德倫（Stephen）向來創意多多，近日他孖張繼聰（阿聰）一齊拍片慶祝萬聖節，片中二人一齊去廁所，Stephen在其中一個尿兜如廁，阿聰行到他身旁，Stephen即時向他發表男廁隱形規矩：「如果有其他空嘅尿兜，你唔會喺正人哋隔離嗰度用</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T16:21:21.779911+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":120,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T16:01:22+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T16:18:12.867300+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T16:18:12.867300+00:00","content_hash":"b8a21803368bd9b39dd9f1ad56d27373da62ce774e9f746aa8a9ecef64e7ad04","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}